      "text": "Here TTL is used for the caching basically means TTL set to 3600sec (1 hr) so 1 hr k andar koi req karega then DNS resolver ANS ko req nhi karega but after 1 hr wo ANS ko req karega",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here TTL is used for the caching basically means TTL set to 3600sec (1 hr) so 1 hr k andar koi req karega then DNS resolver ANS ko req nhi karega but after 1 hr wo ANS ko req karega",
