      "text": "Stateless means ek baar req ki and res mil gaya then server didnt store any state about req so for e.g if req 1st time at /profile and you get it as res and then you need proile again then you have to make new req bcz the old state is not persisted os that's why it's stateless protocol",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Stateless means ek baar req ki and res mil gaya then server didnt store any state about req so for e.g if req 1st time at /profile and you get it as res and then you need proile again then you have to make new req bcz the old state is not persisted os that's why it's stateless protocol",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
