      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786554714131,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Head of line blocking issue happenes here:\nwhat is HOLB?\n- here consider ki index.html bahut badi file hai and wo\nabhi bhi server pe process ho rhi hai so uski wajah se\nimage.jpg and about.html bhi late serve hogi so yehi hai ki\nek badi file ki wajah se dusri files ko serve hone me time\nlagta hai",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Head of line blocking issue happenes here:\nwhat is HOLB?\n- here consider ki index.html bahut badi file hai and wo abhi bhi server pe process ho rhi hai so uski wajah se image.jpg and about.html bhi late serve hogi so yehi hai ki ek badi file ki wajah se dusri files ko serve hone me time lagta hai",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
