      "originalText": "Humne HTTP1.1 use kiya then why we send Connection: Keep-alive??\nkyunki may be ho skta hai ki humne jo req send ki wo proxy k through jaaye and ho skta hai wo proxy HTTP1.0 use karti ho",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
